# Thin whitelist (2026-09-15): track only what is identical on every machine.
# Everything else NEVER syncs: settings.json is machine-specific (captured per
# device by sam-setup), skills/agents/commands are symlinks that install-context
# in codex-config regenerates, and sessions/caches/credentials/memory stay local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/keybindings.json
!/statusline-command.sh
**/.DS_Store
